    "detailed_description": "<strong>Made in Hong Kong. By Unreal Engine 5.2.1.<br><br>Background:</strong><br>Hoiwa Hub is a short horror game that take place in an industrial building. Your workshop is at the end of the hallway. Neighbors are still moving in. <br>But one day, something happened to next door. Then it starts affecting my daily routine. So, I have to deal with ghost events every day.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>Hoiwa Hub is a short game. Game play is around 30-40mins long.<br>&gt; This game contains ghost / blood / killing / cult content.<br>&gt; No post-processing filter / No head bobbing in game. You can enjoy the realistic graphics without motion sickness.<br>&gt; Wide FOV for comfortably gameplay.<br>&gt; Minimal text and no documents to read during gameplay. Enjoy looking around.<br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>- 1st person POV walking simulator<br>- Puzzle solving as usual<br>- Story with several chapters<br>- Small quantity of jump scare<br>- Gore and blood content<br>- Linear gameplay<br><br><strong>Settings:</strong><br>- Supports Full Screen / Windowed Mode<br>- Supports TSR<br>- No save feature. You can access different chapters freely from main menu<br><br>By Unreal Engine 5.2.1.",
